@startuml
title Real-time (SSE) - Publicação de eventos

actor Dashboard
participant "SSEController" as C
participant "EventService" as E
database "Postgres" as DB

== Conectar ==
Dashboard -> C: GET /desks/{deskId}/events/stream
C -> E: subscribe(deskId)
E --> Dashboard: SSE connected

== Evento em mudança de domínio ==
participant "TicketService" as T

T -> DB: UPDATE ticket status=CALLED
T -> E: publish(deskId, type="ticket.called", entityId, payload)
E -> DB: INSERT domain_event
E --> Dashboard: SSE event ticket.called
@enduml